h_number\" id=\"bF=cV]bH#Nodrs41(ui5\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow></value><value name=\"TO\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"[Yi;IMv9z`8FkC|-(hDD\"><field name=\"NUM\">7</field></shadow></value><value name=\"BY\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"J9D_-nP`X4Q0dAuQme~c\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow></value><statement name=\"DO\"><block type=\"controls_for\" id=\"`EJV:a9x}W{zb/R8!6vk\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"NIuYIoF-las.kX44fdMi\">columnas</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"92\" w=\"400\">[it]Questo 'conta con' dà a 'colonne' i valori da 1 a 7 dentro ogni riga, così disegna 7x7 = 49 volte: una per ogni led.[it][en]This 'count with' gives 'columns' the values 1 to 7 inside each row, so it draws 7x7 = 49 times: once for every led.[en][es]Este 'contar con' da a 'columnas' los valores del 1 al 7 dentro de cada fila, así que dibuja 7x7 = 49 veces: una por cada led.[es]</comment><value name=\"FROM\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"6Fo%3z_A4f4[%vrFj|/F\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow></value><value name=\"TO\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"ceS}Ls,oOum6t+4T9,HN\"><field name=\"NUM\">7</field></shadow></value><value name=\"BY\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"791uB3f-qI43Hj8VkN,y\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow></value><statement name=\"DO\"><block type=\"protobject_DibujoLED2_drawOnXY_set_2\" id=\"/Ao|7K[ZqR4rq|Q=PL7S\"><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"(mErD1uf+bA.2/*dRo]P\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"Al1gz8XQtci?BGF:Ajav\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"NIuYIoF-las.kX44fdMi\">columnas</field></block></value><value name=\"VAR2\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"A)Q0OgrpKDu4_1M)8!:T\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\" id=\"PNy-C9(A`zGwj8-(EY21\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"tGA.!dV[O+H:G{k#x7:!\">filas</field></block></value><value name=\"VAR3\"><shadow type=\"colour_picker\" id=\"MgYIAk1ns]AA.i_.]]2{\"><field name=\"COLOUR\">#ff4444</fi